<title>PERU: Peru's Banco de Credito 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Peru's Banco de Credito 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - n.a.</p>
<p>Net - 277 million soles vs 197 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 1.48 billion soles vs 1.02 billion soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Banco de Credito, Peru's leading bank, is 90.1 percent-owned by Credicorp Ltd..</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
